        options: ['A) Identity works fine', 'B) If identical: can\'t be simultaneous with yourself. If inherently different: no reason to always co-occur. Both horns fail — only dependent arising makes simultaneity intelligible.', 'C) Difference works fine', 'D) Both identity and difference work'],
